lake/**/*.doc
lake/**/*.pptx
lake/**/*.ppt
lake/**/*.xlsx
lake/**/*.xls
lake/**/*.epub
lake/**/*.zip
# Imagens brutas no lake (originais pesados). As versões web finais vivem em aulas/.../img/
lake/**/*.png
lake/**/*.jpg
lake/**/*.jpeg
lake/**/*.webp
lake/**/*.gif

